WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:02.520
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:06.470
Today, I’m going to explain a fantasy film
called “Everyday.”

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:07.750
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:09.913
Watch out and take care!

00:00:12.313 --> 00:00:16.900
“A” is a mysterious traveling spirit,
who inhabits the bodies of a different teenager

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.410
for a single day, every day.

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:23.970
The movie begins as Á wakes up in a high
school boy, Justin Smith’s body.

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:28.060
He takes a picture of himself as he does with
everybody he has been in, and sets a timer

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:30.730
for 11:00 PM and 11:50 PM.

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:35.260
Rhiannon is Justin’s girlfriend, that he
is ignorant to.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:40.149
Rhiannon is completely in love with Justin,
but he neither replies to her texts nor treats

00:00:40.149 --> 00:00:41.460
her well.

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:46.750
That day, Á navigates his life as Justin
at school and meets Rhiannon, who apologizes

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:48.929
to him for texting too much.

00:00:48.929 --> 00:00:53.159
Justin tells her that it’s alright, and
he should have texted her back, a total opposite

00:00:53.159 --> 00:00:54.920
to his normal personality.

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:59.999
Rhiannon convinces Justin to skip school with
her, to spend more time with him.

00:00:59.999 --> 00:01:02.570
The two sneakily run out of the school.

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:05.050
The whole day was magical for both of them.

00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:09.600
They sing songs in his car, walk together
in an aquarium, run around the beach happily

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:11.550
and have a lot of fun.

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:15.840
As they walk through the park, Rhiannon tells
him about her dad’s manic episode a few

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:19.490
years ago and how it affected her relationship
with him.

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:22.750
She feels nice that Justin is interested in
her family life.

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:27.811
At the end of the day, as they are about to
separate, A, as Justin tells Rhiannon that

00:01:27.811 --> 00:01:30.250
tomorrow won’t be like today.

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:35.780
Rhiannon however ends the day on a positive
note, citing that tomorrow is tomorrow.

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:38.250
The two kiss and finally separate.

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:40.840
Á seems to have gotten attached to Rhiannon.

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:45.800
It is now the next day, and Á wakes up as
a girl named Amy.

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:49.340
She takes a picture of herself like always
and sets an alarm.

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:53.330
To be closer to Rhiannon, Amy goes to her
high school as a new student.

00:01:53.330 --> 00:01:58.503
Meanwhile, Rhiannon is distressed because
of Justin’s ignorant behaviour towards her again.

00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:04.890
Amy meets Rhiannon, saying that she is a transfer
student, and wants Rhiannon to show her around.

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:09.009
The two are at the chemistry lab when Justin
comes in and complains about missing practice

00:02:09.009 --> 00:02:10.590
the previous day.

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:14.970
He doesn’t seem to remember anything that
happened yesterday, which hurts Rhiannon.

00:02:14.970 --> 00:02:18.010
Justin even blames her for him missing practice.

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:23.030
Amy gets furious and replies to Justin on
Rhiannon’s behalf, saying that he is unappreciative

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:25.840
of the only good thing going on in his life.

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:31.370
Rhiannon asks her to stop, while Justin looks
at her weirdly and leaves.

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:37.270
After the encounter, an upset Rhiannon asks
Amy to be with her friend Alexander, and leaves.

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:38.770
Cut to the following day.

00:02:38.770 --> 00:02:43.209
Á wakes up as a boy named Nathan and does
his usual routine.

00:02:43.209 --> 00:02:46.690
He goes to his computer and searches for an
address on the map.

00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:51.580
Meanwhile, Justin and Rhiannon are at a party
where he leaves her with the keys, and goes

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:53.270
with his friend group.

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:55.290
Rhiannon is alone and awkward.

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:58.790
Justin completely neglects Rhiannon for the
whole night.

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:02.740
She is standing alone, when she sees Nathan
dancing goofily.

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:04.810
She can’t help but join him.

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:09.640
The two are dancing together, when Justin
approaches them standing protectively by Rhiannon’s side.

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:15.849
Nathan introduces himself as Justin’s friend,
Steve’s cousin and says that he is gay.

00:03:15.849 --> 00:03:20.770
He even suggests being attracted to Justin,
so he goes back to his friends.

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:23.710
Nathan then invites Rhiannon to go outside.

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:27.160
They talk about Rhiannon’s type in men,
and laugh.

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:30.980
They talk for a long time, but Nathan has
to go before 12.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:34.760
Meanwhile, Justin figures that Steve has no
cousin.

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:37.930
They run downstairs and chase Nathan away.

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:41.980
The next day, Á wakes up as a blind boy and
cannot find his phone.

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:44.849
So, he spends the whole day in his room.

00:03:44.849 --> 00:03:50.170
Meanwhile, Nathan has become an internet troll,
saying that he was possessed by a devil.

00:03:50.170 --> 00:03:54.890
Rhiannon gets a message from a random number
the next day, asking her to meet the person

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:56.870
in a public place alone.

00:03:56.870 --> 00:04:01.180
She goes to the library, where she is approached
by a girl named Megan.

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:05.840
At first, Megan tells Rhiannon that Nathan
sent her, but then she begins to explain her

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:07.989
life as a moving spirit.

00:04:07.989 --> 00:04:13.220
She reveals that she wakes up as a different
person every day, the day she went out with

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:18.730
Justin, she was Justin; then, she was Amy,
and the previous day, she was Nathan.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:23.480
Rhiannon doesn’t believe any of this and
tries to leave, but Megan begins to recite

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:26.280
the thing she said to Justin on their date.

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:30.870
Rhiannon then assumes that Justin and everyone
else is playing a sick prank on her, but Megan

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:33.180
insists that she is real.

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:35.699
Freaked out, Rhiannon leaves the place.

00:04:35.699 --> 00:04:41.350
The following day, she again gets a text message
from a number, and goes to meet Á in a diner.

00:04:41.350 --> 00:04:44.200
This time it is an Asian boy waiting for her.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:47.780
She quizzes him about all the things she has
done with the people’s bodies he has been

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:50.250
in, and he answers all of them correctly.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:54.600
He then introduces himself as A, a name he
has given himself.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:58.919
Á tells her that he wakes up every day in
a different body which is always near the

00:04:58.919 --> 00:05:02.120
last body, and around the same age as him.

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:05.600
He doesn't know if he has parents, or where
he was born.

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:08.669
He has been changing bodies ever since he
was a kid.

00:05:08.669 --> 00:05:12.520
He tries to leave as little a trace as possible
after living the day.

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:18.156
Á then shows her his Instagram account, where
he posts pictures of everyone he has woken up as.

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:22.680
Rhiannon is still a little skeptical, but
is beginning to believe him.

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:27.530
She tries to investigate the matter herself
and goes to visit Nathan at a Church.

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:31.830
He claims that he was possessed by the Devil
that day, and remembers only bits and pieces

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:33.419
of what happened.

00:05:33.419 --> 00:05:37.862
When he woke up the following day, his phone
was logged into the “devil” Instagram account.

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:42.750
But he claims that the credentials were changed
before he could download any pictures.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:46.610
Rhiannon now fully believes that Á wasn’t
lying.

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:50.660
The following day, she sees a girl looking
at her in the hallways and figures that it

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:54.460
is A. The two talk and she asks him about
Nathan.

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:58.259
It turns out that Á couldn’t make it to
Nathan’s house on time and had to leave

00:05:58.259 --> 00:05:59.790
his body in a hurry.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:03.870
Hence, he had forgotten to log off his Instagram
on Nathan’s phone.

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:08.800
Rhiannon then believes that Á had invaded
her privacy by kissing her as Justin.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:13.312
He apologizes and says that he doesn’t do
that with everyone, but it felt different with her.

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:18.080
He felt something he has never felt before
when he was with Rhiannon that day.

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:21.190
For the same reason, he told her about his
secret.

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:25.630
Later that day, Rhiannon is at Justin’s,
when she asks him what he remembers about

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:29.550
that day, but he too claims that everything
is foggy.

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:34.900
She then asks him questions about their relationship,
but Justin is ignorant of the whole situation.

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:37.870
The next day, Á is a black guy named George.

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:42.060
He calls Rhiannon to meet him in a library,
where he pranks her by acting like he doesn’t

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:43.699
know who she is.

00:06:43.699 --> 00:06:46.139
The two talk about A’s life again.

00:06:46.139 --> 00:06:51.290
In the end, the two kiss, when George’s
overprotective mother comes by and calls Rhiannon a whore.

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:55.990
Rhiannon runs away in her car, smiling the
whole time.

00:06:55.990 --> 00:07:00.800
The following day, Á is beyond surprised
to wake up in Rhiannon’s body.

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:04.860
She excitedly gets off the bed, and tells
herself to be cool about this.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:09.500
While showering, Á makes sure to not look
at Rhiannon’s body.

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:13.250
At school, Justin approaches Rhiannon and
starts to kiss her.

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:17.270
Á is nervous, when he asks Rhiannon to come
over.

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:21.330
She blows up at him, telling him that he doesn’t
understand or appreciate her.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:25.260
Á hopes she won’t get mad at him tomorrow
for doing that.

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:29.389
After school, Rhiannon goes to her dad’s
studio, something that real Rhiannon would

00:07:29.389 --> 00:07:34.580
never do; she bonds with her dad, and he even
makes a painting of her.

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:38.890
Later at night, Á writes everything that
happened today in a note for Rhiannon to read

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:40.979
tomorrow, and goes to sleep.

00:07:40.979 --> 00:07:45.990
Rhiannon reads the note the next day, and
goes to break up with Justin on her own.

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:49.100
She has finally realized that he is not good
for her.

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:53.360
Justin is shocked and wishes her luck before
storming away.

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:56.729
She then calls Á, and tells him about the
breakup.

00:07:56.729 --> 00:08:01.069
She claims that she has never felt more clear
about a decision in her life.

00:08:01.069 --> 00:08:05.410
The scene changes to Rhiannon and Á as a
different guy driving to her uncle's cabin in the woods.

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:09.860
They spend the whole day together talking
and laughing.

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:14.270
The two plan to meet again tomorrow, but Á
has to take the guy back to his place for

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:17.440
the night, so he leaves with the truck they
came in.

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:22.040
The next day, Rhiannon waits for him the whole
day, but Á never shows up.

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:24.819
In the end, she calls her mother to pick her
up in the cabin.

00:08:24.819 --> 00:08:29.730
Her mother is mad at her, for making her drive
three hours on a workday.

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:34.550
The following day, we see Á wake up as a
guy named Michael who is supposed to fly to Holland.

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:40.080
If he goes away, he will be transferred to
somebody from Holland, and never come back,

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:44.200
so he runs away from the house and calls Rhiannon
to come to rescue him.

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:49.040
Rhiannon drives to him in her sister's car,
knocking off the driver's side mirror to escape

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:50.660
from Michael's mother.

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:54.350
She is mad at Á for abandoning her at the
cabin the day before.

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:58.910
Á explains that he woke up as a girl who
was having a lung transplant yesterday, so

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:00.420
he couldn’t come.

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:04.600
He wasn’t even allowed near cell phones,
so he couldn’t call either.

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:09.870
Later, Á takes over the body of a girl named
Kelsey, who was about to commit suicide.

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:14.600
Rhiannon meets him at her house and the two
see that she has already planned out a detailed suicide.

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:20.610
Kelsey's father would only be home at 5 in
the morning, so if Á leaves her body before

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:22.900
that, she will probably kill herself.

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:28.310
Rhiannon wants Á to live in Kelsey’s body,
until her father is home so she can get help.

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:32.730
Á isn’t really sure if he can do that but
tries anyway.

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:37.060
It is 11:59 and Á is still in Kelsey’s
body.

00:09:37.060 --> 00:09:40.430
Kelsey's father comes home later, and Á tells
him that she needs help.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:41.430
Á and Rhiannon are both happy that they could
save someone’s life.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:42.430
The following day, Á has turned into a black
girl.

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:43.430
She meets Rhiannon who asks her to meet him
at night.

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:44.430
However, Á cannot be there because the girl
has a date with her boyfriend and she cannot miss it.

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:49.940
The next day, Á wakes up in Rhiannon's classmate
Alexander's body.

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:54.720
During the day, Á keeps on boasting about
how great of a guy Alexander is.

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:59.330
Rhiannon wants Á to stay in Alexander’s
body for some time as he did with Kelsey’s,

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:01.360
so they can be together for long.

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:05.870
Á reluctantly agrees, and livz as Alexender
for the next few days.

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:11.660
Á totally invades Alexander's privacy, and
declines all of his mother’s calls to enjoy

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:13.570
his time with Rhiannon.

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:18.670
That day, was Alexander’s birthday and his
family had prepared a surprise for him.

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:21.370
He felt bad for ignoring them all day.

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.350
They too were disappointed in him.

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:29.000
Á apologizes to Alexander's mother, and decides
to leave his body after informing Rhiannon tomorrow.

00:10:30.110 --> 00:10:33.860
The next day, Á arranges a beautiful dinner
for Rhiannon.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:38.280
As they talk, he reveals that he won’t be
Alexander from tomorrow as he doesn’t want

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.070
to take over his life.

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:44.680
He tells her that they cannot realistically
be together forever, so he wants Rhiannon

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:49.550
to be with Alexander, because he is a nice
guy and is perfect for her.

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:54.149
Realizing that this is their last night together,
Rhiannon and Á dance and talk; and spend

00:10:54.149 --> 00:10:58.360
their last few hours together, cuddling on
Alexander’s bed.

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:04.370
The next morning, Á wakes up as a rich black
girl, Katie, and drives away in her nice car.

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:09.180
Meanwhile, Rhiannon meets Alexander at school,
who compliments her smile.

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:11.670
The two walk to their call together.

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:16.980
The movie ends as we see Á post a video on
Instagram, enjoying his life as a new person

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:18.310
at the central park.

00:11:18.310 --> 00:11:23.610
Because of his unselfishness, Á decides to
leave Rhiannon's life, so that she could live

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:25.620
happily with someone else.

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:28.709
This is the definition of REAL LOVE.

00:11:28.709 --> 00:11:33.890
Subscribe for more videos like this, turn
on notifications, and leave a like to help

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:34.890
the channel out.

00:11:34.890 --> 00:11:35.569
Thank you for watching.

